WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Think about the last item of clothing you bought.

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:05.200
For me, it was my pants.

3
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:09.000
So let's look at what factors affected that decision.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Was it how you felt when you imagined yourself wearing it?

5
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.500
Was it your friends?

6
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.100
And what you thought they would think?

7
00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:21.300
Was it because you've typically worn this style in the past?

8
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:31.000
Maybe your parents, siblings, or other family members had an influence on your choice.

9
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.200
Maybe you were trying to stay current.

10
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:35.200
We've all done it.

11
00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:37.000
Did you see a commercial?

12
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.200
Maybe an ad or celebrity endorsement that helped convince you?

13
00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:46.000
Was it because of a sale or a discount code that you had?

14
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:51.700
Or was it because of your own sense of values, style, and knowing what you really want?

15
00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:57.200
In addition to all these factors, it's important to ask yourself when making any purchase,

16
00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:01.000
can I afford this before spending the money?

17
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:04.500
Think of there are other things you need you rather spend your money on.

18
00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:10.800
Listen, whether it's intentional or unintentional, all of these factors can influence the choices

19
00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:13.800
and decisions that you make about spending money.

20
00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:15.300
So here's a tip.

21
00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:19.300
When you make decisions about spending money, take a moment to think about which factors

22
00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:21.300
could be affecting your decision.

23
00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:27.200
After all, sometimes we make good decisions like my pants.
